WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.641 --> 00:00:06.080
- I've never had a Lunchable.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.075
- I've wanted them, 'cause they
had like, cool commercials.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.419
- I always thought they
looked like, Play-Doh?

00:00:12.419 --> 00:00:14.880
- Cracker Stackers, this looks fun.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.899
- A lot of fat, (laughs), that's cool.

00:00:17.899 --> 00:00:19.617
- Oh, it comes with a drink.

00:00:19.617 --> 00:00:21.846
- The meat is like, watery.
- Do I like, touch it?

00:00:21.846 --> 00:00:26.002
- I have this block of sweaty cheese.

00:00:26.002 --> 00:00:27.505
- I'm touching a dog's tongue.

00:00:28.556 --> 00:00:31.505
- Half of this package is a Reese's cup.

00:00:31.505 --> 00:00:32.870
- Can I put the Reese's on top?

00:00:33.873 --> 00:00:35.708
- I would eat this, like, at a

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:38.076
field trip to the zoo or something.

00:00:38.076 --> 00:00:38.982
- This is the one that I always saw

00:00:38.982 --> 00:00:41.327
when I was a kid, the pizza one.

00:00:41.327 --> 00:00:43.068
- I just love how future this is.

00:00:43.068 --> 00:00:45.227
- The kind of food the astronauts eat.

00:00:45.227 --> 00:00:49.078
- Ugh.
- This doesn't appeal to me.

00:00:50.565 --> 00:00:52.863
- This is the other crust.
- That was kind of fun.

00:00:52.863 --> 00:00:55.348
- A tiny bit of mozzarella on top.

00:00:55.348 --> 00:00:56.616
- A giant nipple.

00:01:00.255 --> 00:01:01.444
- Edible.
- I actually feel good

00:01:01.444 --> 00:01:02.291
about this one.

00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:03.939
- This would definitely
save you from a bully

00:01:03.939 --> 00:01:05.773
if you gave it to him.

00:01:05.773 --> 00:01:08.746
- Pancakes, they make breakfast?

00:01:08.746 --> 00:01:10.533
- There's something that

00:01:10.533 --> 00:01:12.855
some people might refer to as bacon.

00:01:12.855 --> 00:01:15.920
- I wonder how long it's
been in this box? (cough)

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.408
- Upsettingly squishy.

00:01:17.408 --> 00:01:19.054
- [Dark Haired Girl] Very weird.

00:01:19.054 --> 00:01:20.461
- Just like a sponge.

00:01:22.538 --> 00:01:23.366
- Eh.

00:01:25.417 --> 00:01:27.483
- Oh my god, that was really good.

00:01:27.483 --> 00:01:29.225
- This is fantastic, did
other people like this?

00:01:29.225 --> 00:01:30.943
- (laughs) Did anyone like this?

00:01:30.943 --> 00:01:32.824
- This is childhood
dream, just to like have

00:01:32.824 --> 00:01:36.655
tiny pancakes that you dip,
and then you make a mess

00:01:36.655 --> 00:01:39.260
and get all over your fingers
and then you touch stuff.

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:42.278
- Barbecue Chicken Shake Ups.

00:01:42.278 --> 00:01:44.507
- Rip it, pour it, seal and shake it.

00:01:44.507 --> 00:01:46.133
- The last thing I want to do is

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:50.568
put barbecue sauce on this,
shake it up, and then eat it.

00:01:50.568 --> 00:01:53.215
- It's like watery and
soggy, but I'm so distracted

00:01:53.215 --> 00:01:56.303
by the seasoning
- Kids love chicken nuggets.

00:01:56.303 --> 00:01:58.462
- I don't like the chicken nuggets.

00:01:58.462 --> 00:02:00.691
- If you told a robot, I would like you

00:02:00.691 --> 00:02:05.381
to put together a barbecue chicken finger,

00:02:05.381 --> 00:02:07.099
this is what that robot would give you.

00:02:07.099 --> 00:02:08.168
- I'm gonna go tell my parents

00:02:08.168 --> 00:02:09.863
that I finally had Lunchables.

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:11.929
- I'm just gonna eat a lot of salad.

00:02:11.929 --> 00:02:13.887
- I don't think that this
qualifies as a lunch.

00:02:13.887 --> 00:02:16.743
I'm not sure that it qualifies as food.

00:02:16.743 --> 00:02:18.090
- If you're a really busy parent, with

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:21.249
a high powered job,
Lunchables are the way to go.

